<http://musicbrainz.org/place/82403c7e-9eb1-4aac-8928-c953066e4cf9#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Archived page with a list of concerts: http://web.archive.org/web/20111221004951/http://www.museumsplatz-konzerte.de/veranstaltungen.html" <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/194cd897-7894-4e5c-9f28-ea48373b20d9#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "== History ==\r\nOriginally opened as ON AIR in February 1991.\r\nChanged its name to ON AIR EAST in July 1994 upon the opening of ON AIR WEST.\r\nClosed in July 2002 for extensive remodeling.\r\nReopened on December 21, 2003 as Shibuya O-East.\r\nChanged its name to Tsutaya O-East after Culture Convenience Club purchased the naming rights." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/bd55aeb7-19d1-4607-a500-14b8479d3fed#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[https://www.discogs.com/label/268293-Anvil-Recording-Studios|Anvil Studios] at this location 1980-1984" <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/32c2b16a-3c70-4385-9205-8b0d3961a6a6#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Used to be [https://musicbrainz.org/place/6c8242be-15e4-466f-a3ac-85d34ead102f|located at Strandlodsvej 85] but moved to its current position in the late 1990's." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/1d458f55-d60e-4961-9d21-18a3f6948775#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Live music and events venue located in Berlin Kreuzberg / Tempelhof, Germany. Previously known as ColumbiaFritz (1998 to 2002), Columbiaclub (C-Club) (2002 to 2015), renamed Columbia Theater in October 2015." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/f6e5fd67-65ef-4a4d-8341-4f3d4fa1418a#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "please use the appropriate studio based on their respective locations:\r\n'''[place:9d17e34b-8dd2-4a59-9a7d-fca9828049f5|Sony Music Studios, London]'''\r\n'''[place:ed121457-87f6-4df9-a24b-d3f1bab1fdad|Sony Music Studios, New York City]'''\r\n'''[place:df6aeb21-eebd-4660-a4db-db6a6dbf9677|Sony Music Studios, Sydney]'''\r\n'''[place:bdb64603-8af6-454d-bbb0-5b3ef7fc7e36|Sony Music Studios, Los Angeles]'''\r\n'''[place:f6e5fd67-65ef-4a4d-8341-4f3d4fa1418a|Sony Music Studios, Tokyo]'''" <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
