<http://musicbrainz.org/place/ce02592c-e1ad-4e3f-9382-07dd9e4490c6#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This venue closed on October 4, 2015, and was later demolished and rebuilt. Its successor, LINE CUBE SHIBUYA, has its own entity." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/194cd897-7894-4e5c-9f28-ea48373b20d9#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "== History ==\nOriginally opened as ON AIR in February 1991.\nChanged its name to ON AIR EAST in July 1994 upon the opening of ON AIR WEST.\nClosed in July 2002 for extensive remodeling.\nReopened on December 21, 2003 as Shibuya O-East.\nChanged its name to Tsutaya O-East after Culture Convenience Club purchased the naming rights.\nThe venue has been known as Spotify O-EAST since a deal with the company took effect December 1, 2021." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/ce02592c-e1ad-4e3f-9382-07dd9e4490c6#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This venue closed on October 4, 2015 and was subsequently demolished and rebuilt from the ground up. Its successor, [https://musicbrainz.org/place/71bb7c44-c774-4c6a-a282-7fe4bfa997d8|LINE CUBE SHIBUYA], has its own entity. '''Please do not use this entity for relationships for Events that took place (or Releases/Recordings that were recorded/filmed) after October 4, 2015.'''" <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/71cbd667-fe1a-4b35-b4a3-f5ee193ddb32#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This place is assigned to the municipality of Bornich, because more than 2/3 is on its ground. The rest belongs to the municipality of St. Goarshausen.\r\n\r\n[https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/323329463#map=19/50.14262/7.73140|OpenStreetMap reference]" <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/eac5ce60-3280-479e-9a38-66d6d2e4c9ff#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "History\n1993-12 to 2003-12: ON AIR WEST\n2003-12 to 2013-12: Shibuya O-WEST\n2013-12 to 2021-11: TSUTAYA O-WEST\n2021-12 to present: Spotify O-WEST" <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/place/1d458f55-d60e-4961-9d21-18a3f6948775#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Previously known as ColumbiaFritz (1998 to 2002), Columbiaclub (C-Club) (2002 to 2015), renamed Columbia Theater in October 2015." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_place_3> .
