<http://musicbrainz.org/label/7c614735-33ba-4bed-bbb7-89b7e72ce9bb#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Current releases belonging to this page say \"SME Records\" with \"SME Records Inc.\" in smaller text underneath.  These releases must have a SECL catalog number.\r\n\r\nBefore a company reorganization on 2003-04-01, releases for this label said \"SME Records\" with '''\"Sony Music Records Inc.\"''' or \"'''[http://www.musicbrainz.org/label/0331bcea-3905-4893-9874-1d3f10480625|Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc.]'''\" in smaller text underneath. These releases used catalogue numbers starting with SRCS and SRCL (and possibly others) for standard CDs." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/7c614735-33ba-4bed-bbb7-89b7e72ce9bb#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Releases for this label originally said \"SME Records\" with \"'''[http://www.musicbrainz.org/label/0331bcea-3905-4893-9874-1d3f10480625|Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc.]'''\" in smaller text underneath. These releases used catalogue numbers starting with SRCS and SRCL (and possibly others) for standard CDs.\r\n\r\nOn 2003-04-01, Sony reorganised their company, creating several new subcompanies. Now SME releases say \"SME Records\" with \"SME Records Inc.\" in smaller text underneath. These releases use catalogue numbers starting with SECL for standard CDs." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/7c614735-33ba-4bed-bbb7-89b7e72ce9bb#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Releases belonging to this imprint since 2003 should be copyrighted by \"'''SME Records Inc.'''\"  SME Records Inc. assigns SECL catalog numbers, but not all such releases belong here.\r\n\r\nBetween 2001 and 2003, releases using the \"SME Records\" imprint attributed copyright to \"Sony Music Records Inc.\".  Between 1998 and 2001, releases attributed copyright to \"[http://www.musicbrainz.org/label/0331bcea-3905-4893-9874-1d3f10480625|Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc.]\" in smaller text underneath." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/7c614735-33ba-4bed-bbb7-89b7e72ce9bb#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The SME Records imprint was launched in late 1998 as a label for Japanese artists and a reissue label for Columbia Records (US) artists.  In 2001, the Columbia artists were moved to [label:c9a4ea86-7611-4fff-9f4f-41f18be7e14b|a new walking eye imprint], with SME Records now focused exclusively on Japanese music.\r\n\r\nKnown cancelled releases:\r\nSECL-963\r\nSECL-965\r\nSECL-989\r\nSECL-991\r\nSECL-1138~9\r\nSECL-1549~50\r\nSECL-1551" <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/c595c289-47ce-4fba-b999-b87503e8cb71#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Warner label originally used for film soundtracks, but now commonly used for general albums.\r\nThe imprint is used across the world, but some albums were marketed under different imprints in some territories (e.g. Japan)." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/7c614735-33ba-4bed-bbb7-89b7e72ce9bb#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Releases belonging to this imprint since 2003 have the text \"'''SME Records'''\" with \"'''SME Records Inc.'''\" in smaller text underneath.  These releases '''must have a SECL catalog number'''.\r\n\r\nBetween 2001 and 2003, releases using the \"SME Records\" imprint attributed copyright to \"Sony Music Records Inc.\".  Between 1998 and 2001, releases attributed copyright to \"[http://www.musicbrainz.org/label/0331bcea-3905-4893-9874-1d3f10480625|Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc.]\" in smaller text underneath." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/7c614735-33ba-4bed-bbb7-89b7e72ce9bb#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Releases belonging to this imprint since 2003 should be copyrighted by \"'''SME Records Inc.'''\"  SME Records Inc. assigns SECL catalog numbers, but not all such releases belong here.\r\n\r\nFrom 1998-2001, SME Records released both domestic and international.  Since 2002, SME Records only releases Japanese music.\r\n\r\nBetween 2001 and 2003, the \"SME Records\" imprint controlled by \"Sony Music Records Inc.\".  Between 1998 and 2001, it was directly under the control of \"[http://www.musicbrainz.org/label/0331bcea-3905-4893-9874-1d3f10480625|Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc.]\"." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/7c614735-33ba-4bed-bbb7-89b7e72ce9bb#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Releases for this label originally said \"SME Records\" with \"Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc.\" in smaller text underneath. These releases used catalogue numbers starting with SRCS and SRCL (and possibly others) for standard CDs.\r\n\r\nOn 2003-04-01, Sony reorganised their company, creating several new subcompanies. Now SME releases say \"SME Records\" with \"SME Records Inc.\" in smaller text underneath. These releases use catalogue numbers starting with SECL for standard CDs." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/c595c289-47ce-4fba-b999-b87503e8cb71#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Warner label originally used for film soundtracks, but now commonly used for general albums.\r\nThe imprint is used across the world, but some albums were marketed under different imprints in some territories (e.g. Japan).\r\nCurrently run as a sister label to [http://musicbrainz.org/label/af6d6f49-2b4d-40fe-86d4-241906772b59.html|Reprise] (LC: 322). Be ccareful to file releases correctly." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/label/c595c289-47ce-4fba-b999-b87503e8cb71#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Warner label originally used for film soundtracks, but now commonly used for general albums.\r\nThe imprint is used across the world, but some albums were marketed under different imprints in some territories (e.g. Japan).\r\nCurrently run as a sister label to [http://musicbrainz.org/label/af6d6f49-2b4d-40fe-86d4-241906772b59.html|Reprise] (LC: 322). Be careful to file releases correctly." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_label_4> .
