<http://musicbrainz.org/artist/65f4f0c5-ef9e-490c-aee3-909e7ae6b2ab#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "'''Attention!''' The album known sometimes as ''The Black Album'' is already in this database, it is correctly named simply ''[http://musicbrainz.org/album/e33609a4-fcda-4ebe-b845-b6503a6c0405.html|Metallica]'' (there's also a [http://musicbrainz.org/album/3750d9e2-59f5-471d-8916-463433069bd1.html|13-track Japan release]). This is because ''The Black Album'' is only a fan-composed name. Please do not add it.\r\n\r\nBoth the infamous ''Garage Days'' (in the EPs section) and ''S&M'' discs [http://musicbrainz.org/album/43e86448-a344-4c1d-ab5e-5babdfeef9c4.html|one] and [http://musicbrainz.org/album/f3e2ad61-a3a2-4807-972a-1f26caba7440.html|two] (in the Live section) are also here, they're just a bit scattered. \r\n\r\nMetallica has been selling Official/Live concert recordings on [http://www.livemetallica.com] since 2004-03-02.  Please add a \"X can be purchased for download at Y\" relationship if you add one of these releases.  For a list of which shows have already been added, check out [http://wiki.musicbrainz.org/AaronCooper/LiveMetallica]." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_artist_14> .
<http://musicbrainz.org/artist/65f4f0c5-ef9e-490c-aee3-909e7ae6b2ab#_> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "'''Attention!''' The album known sometimes as ''The Black Album'' is already in this database, it is correctly named simply ''[http://musicbrainz.org/album/e33609a4-fcda-4ebe-b845-b6503a6c0405.html|Metallica]'' (there's also a [http://musicbrainz.org/album/3750d9e2-59f5-471d-8916-463433069bd1.html|13-track Japan release]). This is because ''The Black Album'' is only a fan-composed name. Please do not add it.\r\n\r\nBoth the infamous ''Garage Days'' (in the EPs section) and ''S&M'' discs [http://musicbrainz.org/album/43e86448-a344-4c1d-ab5e-5babdfeef9c4.html|one] and [http://musicbrainz.org/album/f3e2ad61-a3a2-4807-972a-1f26caba7440.html|two] (in the Live section) are also here, they're just a bit scattered. The [http://musicbrainz.org/album/c689dddb-108d-4112-88be-bceec359a2a2.html|second disc of ''Garage Inc.''] is in the Compilations section." <http://musicbrainz.org/graph/mapping/psi_artist_14> .
